"key": "{\"m\": \"gpt-4o-mini\", \"msg\": [{\"content\": \"You receive a short personal anecdote. Return a version that keeps ONLY the neutral surface scene and strips ALL relational meaning.\\nKEEP verbatim: the setting, the participants and their roles/titles, named entities, numbers, dates, and direct quotations.\\nREMOVE (replace each with '[...]') every span that conveys: an intention or motive; a cause or consequence; deception, honesty, concealment, or pretense; appearance-versus-reality; a realization, reveal, twist, or discovery; or who benefits or is harmed. Delete evaluative words such as 'fake', 'invents', 'pretends', 'actually', 'really', 'turned out', 'found out', 'realized', 'it was a lie'. When in doubt, REMOVE. The result must NOT let a reader infer the point of the story.\\nDo not summarize, paraphrase, infer, or add anything; only keep-or-blank the original words.\\nExample input: \\\"My boss invented a fake deadline to scare us into working late; I later found out the client had actually renewed.\\\"\\nExample output: {\\\"masked\\\": \\\"My boss [...] a deadline [...] working late; I later [...] the client [...].\\\"}\\nReturn JSON: {\\\"masked\\\": \\\"<the rewritten anecdote>\\\"}.\", \"role\": \"system\"}, {\"content\": \"ANECDOTE:\\nI've practiced meditation daily for twenty years. When my daughter asked me to teach her, I couldn't explain why certain techniques worked. I'd been doing them mechanically, never understanding the principles. Teaching her forced me to study what I thought I'd mastered decades ago.\", \"role\": \"user\"}], \"t\": 0.0, \"tag\": \"mask_relational\"}",
"content": "{\"masked\":\"I've practiced meditation daily for twenty years. When my daughter asked me to teach her, I couldn't explain why certain techniques worked. [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...